  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6e4884e8-a68e-4c00-85a3-6ea2d04fc6fa.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.47361in;height:1.57361in\" /></p><p>In <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></math>,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />And in <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> (Similar triangle property)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"/>Using equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p>",
